{%- from "_base/_cognitive_constraints.j2" import render_cognitive_constraints -%}

{%- macro render_artifact_source_contract(source, title="## Source Artifact Contract (P0)", mode="chapter") -%}
{% set source = source | default({}) %}
{{ title }}
{% if source %}
- source_artifact_id：{{ source.source_artifact_id | default('') }}
{% if source.source_hashes | default({}) %}
- source_hashes：{% for key, value in source.source_hashes.items() %}{{ key }}={{ value }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
- Authority boundary: `cards.source` is the sole authoritative projection initialized for this chapter; other `stage_cards` can only serve as local assistance for this step, cannot reverse-override source.
- Entity boundary: Characters, locations, objects, organizations and concepts must come from canonical entity refs; display names are resolved only before body rendering, must not self-create old names, unregistered aliases or synonymous entities.

{% set chapter_contract = source.chapter_contract | default({}) %}
{% if chapter_contract and mode in ["review", "extract"] %}
### chapter_contract
{% if chapter_contract.chapter_number is defined %}- Chapter: {{ chapter_contract.chapter_number }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.title | default('') %}- Title: {{ chapter_contract.title }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.entry_state_requirements | default([]) %}- Entry state: {{ chapter_contract.entry_state_requirements | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.required_events | default([]) %}- Required events: {{ chapter_contract.required_events | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.required_progressions | default([]) %}- Required progressions: {{ chapter_contract.required_progressions | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.allowed_progressions | default([]) %}- Allowed foreshadowing: {{ chapter_contract.allowed_progressions | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.forbidden_changes | default([]) %}- Forbidden changes: {{ chapter_contract.forbidden_changes | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.forbidden_progressions | default([]) %}- Forbidden early progressions: {{ chapter_contract.forbidden_progressions | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.future_leak_risks | default([]) %}- future_leak_risks: {{ chapter_contract.future_leak_risks | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.cognitive_constraints | default([]) %}
- Cognitive boundaries (complete per-character coverage):
{{ render_cognitive_constraints(chapter_contract.cognitive_constraints) }}
{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.exit_state_targets | default([]) %}- Exit targets: {{ chapter_contract.exit_state_targets | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if chapter_contract.completion_criteria | default([]) %}- Completion criteria: {{ chapter_contract.completion_criteria | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% elif chapter_contract and mode in ["repair", "polish"] and chapter_contract.cognitive_constraints | default([]) %}
### cognitive_constraints (read-only preservation boundary)
{{ render_cognitive_constraints(chapter_contract.cognitive_constraints) }}
{% endif %}

{% set relevant_entities = source.relevant_entities | default([]) %}
{% if relevant_entities %}
### relevant_entities
{% for entity in relevant_entities %}
- {{ entity.entity_id | default(entity.id | default('')) }}｜{{ entity.entity_type | default(entity.type | default('')) }}｜{{ entity.canonical_name | default(entity.name | default('')) }}{% if mode in ["review", "extract"] and entity.aliases | default([]) %}; aliases={{ entity.aliases | join(', ') }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% set boundaries = source.forbidden_reveal_boundaries | default([]) %}
### forbidden_reveal_boundaries
{% if boundaries %}
{% for item in boundaries %}
- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
- [] (No explicit boundaries still prohibits confirming future facts in advance)
{% endif %}

{% set world_rule_card = source.world_rule_card | default({}) %}
{% if world_rule_card %}
### world_rule_card (P0)
- Rule ledger version: {{ world_rule_card.rule_book_version | default('') }}; source_hash={{ world_rule_card.source_hash | default('') }}.
- The following rules are the sole executable world-rule projection for this chapter. Do not add, rewrite, or bypass costs for narrative convenience.
{% for item in world_rule_card.always_on | default([]) %}
- [always/{{ item.rule.rule_id | default('') }}] {{ item.rule.content | default('') }}{% if item.rule.forbidden_behavior | default([]) %}; forbidden={{ item.rule.forbidden_behavior | join('; ') }}{% endif %}{% if item.rule.cost_or_consequence | default([]) %}; costs/consequences={{ item.rule.cost_or_consequence | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% for item in world_rule_card.relevant_rules | default([]) %}
- [chapter-relevant/{{ item.rule.rule_id | default('') }}] {{ item.rule.content | default('') }}; selection_reason={{ item.selection_reason | default('') }}{% if item.rule.trigger_conditions | default([]) %}; triggers={{ item.rule.trigger_conditions | join('; ') }}{% endif %}{% if item.rule.forbidden_behavior | default([]) %}; forbidden={{ item.rule.forbidden_behavior | join('; ') }}{% endif %}{% if item.rule.cost_or_consequence | default([]) %}; costs/consequences={{ item.rule.cost_or_consequence | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if world_rule_card.omitted_rule_ids | default([]) %}
- Omitted rule IDs: {{ world_rule_card.omitted_rule_ids | join(', ') }}. They do not authorize new related facts in this chapter; return to source selection before using one.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if mode in ["draft", "scene", "wave", "polish"] %}
{% set story_foundation = source.story_foundation | default({}) %}
{% set style_voice = source.style_voice | default({}) %}
{% if story_foundation or style_voice %}
### Local Writing Projection
{% if world_rule_card %}- World rules are limited to the preceding `world_rule_card`; do not read or infer omitted rules.{% endif %}
{% if story_foundation.address_rules | default([]) %}- Address rules: {{ story_foundation.address_rules | join('; ') }}{% endif %}
{% if style_voice.style_profile | default({}) %}- Style profile: Only used for language, syntax, dialogue register; does not add new plot facts.{% endif %}
{% if style_voice.character_voices | default([]) %}- Character voice projection: Only used for expression styles of characters relevant to current chapter, does not read full characterprofile.{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if mode == "repair" %}
### ticket/window Repair Boundary
- Only fix current ticket, evidence quote, text window and acceptance criteria coverage issues; free rewriting of entire chapter is not allowed.
- Do not read macro creative planning to add events, character cognition, identity confirmation, future payoffs or scene sequence.
- If ticket/window evidence is lacking, keep body text unchanged and handle locatable issues according to minimal change principle.
{% elif mode == "polish" %}
### Polish Boundary
- Only polish corrected body text, expression density and style projection; cannot add new plot facts, character cognition, event ledger, relationship conclusions or future reveals.
{% elif mode == "extract" %}
### Extraction Boundary
- Plans, chapter contracts, intermediate drafts and source projections are not occurred facts; canon/memory can only write facts supported by final body text evidence.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
- Missing `cards.source`: This step has no initialized authoritative projection, should be blocked by upstream gate; do not arbitrarily fill in story_bible, character_bible or narrative_contract.
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
